  "detail_text": "ON OR ABOUT MARCH 17, 2026, I WILL POST AN RFQ TO PROVIDE Generator Maintenance. PLEASE FILL OUT THE ATTACHED REQUEST FOR THE QUOTE, (RFQ), AND EMAIL THE COMPLETED DOCUMENT BACK IN ORDER TO BE CONSIDERED FOR AWARD. THE CLOSING OF THE BUY WILL BE ON (March 27, 2026 @ 1:00 EST). ALL QUESTIONS MUST BE ADDRESSED BY EMAIL NO LATER THAN 24 HOURS PRIOR TO THE CLOSING. PLEASE PROVIDE EXACTLY WHAT THE GOVERNMENT IS REQUESTING. SEE PERFORMANCE WORK STATEMENT OF WORK AND OTHER ATTACHMENTS FOR MORE DETAIL IF IN INCLUDED. ALL CAPABILITIES ARE TO BE SUBMITTED TO MARCUS.WATTS@VA.GOV",
